        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eric Dane, Garry Marshall\n- Works: Charmed, Grey's Anatomy, Marley & Me, Valentine's Day, Burlesque\n- Topics: television roles, films\n\nFacts:\n- Throughout the 2000s, Eric Dane appeared in television roles such as Charmed.\n- Eric Dane became known for playing Dr. Mark Sloan on the medical drama television series Grey's Anatomy.\n- In 2008, Eric Dane co-starred in the film Marley & Me.\n- Valentine's Day is a 2010 American romantic comedy film.\n- In 2010, Eric Dane co-starred in the films Valentine's Day and Burlesque.\n- Garry Marshall directed the 2010 film Valentine's Day.",
